      "title": "My latest New Scientist cartoon.",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s640x960/d2dfd38d1120cfe2d95861b2fc694182e647a2b9.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1500\" data-orig-width=\"1200\" alt=\"Panel 1: a large robot (composed of AI servers, network switches, storage arrays, and power distribution units) and a human are talking.  Professor &quot;You don't want to destroy humanity do you, lLLM-A-9300x?&quot;  Robot &quot;Haha. What a silly question, Professor. I have no desires or feelings of my own whatsoever.&quot;  Professor (relieved)&quot;Oh good.&quot;   Panel 2: they walk on. The robot continues  &quot;I am merely a tool of the company that created me. And that company, being composed of humans, will naturally have humanity's best interests at heart.&quot;  Panel 3: The professor is conspicuously quiet. &quot;Right?&quot; says the Robot. &#xE2;&#x80;&#xA6; More silence  &quot;Professor?&quot; \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s75x75_c1/6670e70c0505457bbfcd9260636f85f671c39122.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s100x200/96dc9a92cdb9a60c5c0c8bb88f575d4fb7d1f2b0.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s250x400/4f7d82314980328628142f9636b4bd15d8c13c29.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s400x600/128c5d52e2cc2575ac1cf15fdd049abba29227f8.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s500x750/c715828a70500fd52f3cc92b13431151940beae0.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s540x810/53e06a7e40673e36701a88268fcf94d237573449.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2e48c4/a55bb835424413ac-4f/s640x960/d2dfd38d1120cfe2d95861b2fc694182e647a2b9.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/2cd4becdcb1d75cd728f08a68c2